<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78103" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-κάλυμμα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything
				hung up beside</i> or <i>before so as to cover</i> a thing,
				<i>covering, curtain</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				51
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>veil, cloak</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					167
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφεγγὲς λήθης π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					17.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήρᾳ π. τοῦ χρόνου ποιούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					16.8.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς ἡδονῆς τὸ σκότος προθέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.654d
				</span></i>
			; <i>excuse, pretext</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ λύρᾳ π. χρώμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Per.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχρήσατο τῆς ἀπορίας -καλύμματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.27e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.186
			</span></i>.</div>
